<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-956] RowIdJob fails if logsCRCfilter is not set.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-956</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;RowIdJob when executed doesn&apos;t ignore &apos;_SUCCESS&apos; or &apos;*crc&apos; files as PathFilters.logsCRCFilter is not set. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;0.6 snapshot from trunk&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
        <key id="12539680">MAHOUT-956</key>
            <summary>RowIdJob fails if logsCRCfilter is not set.</summary>
