                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="13192601" author="smarthi" created="Tue, 24 Jan 2012 22:10:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Passing PathFilters.logCRCFilters() fixes the issue. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13193315" author="smarthi" created="Wed, 25 Jan 2012 20:47:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;fixed patch for Mahout-956&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13193316" author="smarthi" created="Wed, 25 Jan 2012 20:47:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Pass in PathFilters.logCRCFilters as parameter when converting the vectors to matrix so as to ignore any .crc and &apos;_SUCCESS&apos;/&apos;_logs&apos; files.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13195115" author="gsingers" created="Fri, 27 Jan 2012 21:41:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Small enough that it should go in 0.6&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
